    {
      "uid": "zhcn:999405e0f749bf17ef056c7a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……那些特别的事情、美好的回忆，都和烟花一样吧。\n美妙的时间，总是不经意间转瞬即逝。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfd38d1ac659a9c58bef6de3df4307ff3781f2fbc65cfe142f0294940b558fc6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
