    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f75d3705ad53a6f97f15e9c4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是，正因为这一切的时光都是有限的、\n所以才显得弥足珍贵、所以才能在心中留下美好的回忆……\n对吧——？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e66ed267b244d87421d67cffea7ca3774e6329c2c6b4d5f701e386dca3add7c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1022/storytimeline_041022007.json",
      "json_path": [
