      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……啊，抱歉！难得来庙会玩，\n但我又把气氛搞得凝重起来了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "409a8c4610d349b7a3e052dbc0d03c4a06e7a385d246af2c23ce362aee52fffe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
