    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ade491c616c05fc786e880bd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "好啦，一起逛逛这边的店家吧？\n刚刚我在那边看见了『超大章鱼烧』的看板了哦――",
      "source_fingerprint": "87f0ae881174ef5960bfc9d2f0a16b2919b6f12bb85ad35c073159fcb320867f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
