    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd0b0fba32b2599d8cbdcb1a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "接着，我和美妙姿势一起逛着庙会。\n今年的夏季集训，最终平安无事地结束了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "38b5da5c82d1ebafddeb4f6c8171f5da9abbba120d7287a43e1f38de7c58ca51",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
